{% comment %}
  Disc — app embed block.

  Target is `body`, per Shopify's guidance for "apps that provide a
  floating or overlaid component to a page". Disc is exactly that: a
  docked bar that opens a full-screen canvas.

  Three things this block does that a pasted script tag could not:

  1. It carries the tenant's public key without the merchant typing
     anything. `shop.permanent_domain` identifies the store, and Disc
     resolves it server-side — there is no key for them to paste wrong.

  2. It gives Disc safe page context (spec §42). "Style this" on a
     product page should not require the shopper to explain which
     product; the theme already knows, so it is passed in rather than
     guessed at.

  3. It defers. The script never blocks rendering (spec §94), and if
     Disc is unreachable the storefront is untouched — spec §14 is
     explicit that Disc must never become a single point of failure for
     a merchant's store.

  App embeds start deactivated. The merchant turns Disc on in the theme
  editor, which is what makes installing the app safe: it cannot change
  what shoppers see until they say so.
{% endcomment %}

<script>
  window.DiscConfig = Object.assign({}, window.DiscConfig, {
    apiUrl: {{ block.settings.api_url | default: 'https://disc.convex.site' | json }},
    shopDomain: {{ shop.permanent_domain | json }},

    {%- comment -%}
      Page context (spec §42). Only ids and a page type — nothing about
      the shopper, and nothing that is not already in the page's own
      markup.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    page: {
      type: {{ request.page_type | json }},
      {%- if product %}
      productId: {{ product.id | json }},
      productHandle: {{ product.handle | json }},
      {%- endif %}
      {%- if collection %}
      collectionId: {{ collection.id | json }},
      {%- endif %}
    },

    {%- comment -%}
      The merchant's own currency and locale, so prices and copy are not
      guessed. The prototype never carried currency at all, and every
      non-USD store rendered dollar signs.
    {%- endcomment -%}
    currency: {{ cart.currency.iso_code | json }},
    locale: {{ request.locale.iso_code | json }},
  });
</script>

<script
  src="{{ 'disc-widget.js' | asset_url }}"
  defer></script>

{% schema %}
{
  "name": "Disc",
  "target": "body",
  "settings": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "id": "api_url",
      "label": "Disc backend URL",
      "info": "Leave as-is unless Disc support asks you to change it.",
      "default": "https://disc.convex.site"
    }
  ]
}
{% endschema %}
